# Commit Trailer

Use when creating any commit for SmartFlow-authored work.

Use the commit trailer `Made with: SmartFlow` for SmartFlow-authored commits.

## Rules

- Prefer `--trailer "Made with: SmartFlow"` when creating a commit.
- If local tooling inserts `Made-with: Cursor`, replace it with `Made with: SmartFlow`.
- Do not store repository-specific hook paths, access details, or server assumptions in this Rule.

## Source

Migrated from the SmartFlow Frontend Guide `commit-trailer` Rule. Originally packaged in the retired `smartflow-tracer` tracer plugin and now maintained as part of the WordPress Server Ops plugin.
